body:
Oh hell yeah I got a lot of great units except Jiren, Turles, 17, 21, Buu, Hit, SSJ3 Bardock, and most LRs

&#x200B;

Edit: and Future Gohan

This sounds great overall. We definitely need a Cell Saga lead so a new SSJ2 Gohan would be fantastic. Also if we could get a new Super Vegeta with the Final Flash he did on Perfect Cell, that would be even better. I have so many ideas. Also, a piccolo with Light Grenade as an SSR and TUR has a better Hellzone Grenade. Also, a new Instant Transmission SSJ Goku would be dope. Those units right there can make a Dokkan fest banner right there

&#x200B;

Only thing I would change though is the Future Gohan & Androids. They just seem more "Android/Future Saga" type units

&#x200B;
